Z||000000||mbramble||10-21-2000||01:14 PM||||Drove from Pensacola to Panama City (200m round trip) to pick up some uniforms for the baseball tourney my son is playing in next weekend.  They could have been mailed to us but wanted to make the drive to see how the car did, in preparation for driving it to the tourney in S. FL.  Ran beautifully.  Love the sunroof and power windows!!  Best part -- got 38 mpg with my 2.5L.||||reg||1
Z||000001||StuGood||10-21-2000||02:04 PM||||Pretty amazing gas mileage!  Remember back when you had to put up with driving a Beetle to get 30mpg?!<P>Don't suppose you had so much fun driving you forgot to pack the uniforms  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">?   ||||reg||6
Z||000002||mbramble||10-21-2000||03:38 PM||||Nope, didn't foerget them.  The coach said "as someone who is familiar with those cars, I hope you have enough room for the uniforms"!!  <P>I was amazed by the mileage.  Best I've ever gotten before on short highway trips was about 33.  But, it was 198 miles and I filled up when we got back and it took 5.1 gallons to top off the tank.  Heck that's almost as good as my wife's little Geo Metro!!  Almost....||||reg||1
